      "title": {
        "en": "Co ty na to?"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "To suggest something, *może kupimy mu płytę?*, and then *co ty na to?* (what do you say?). Yes: *świetny pomysł!*, *idealnie!* (perfect!). No: *to bez sensu* (that makes no sense), *to banalne* (that's too obvious), *nie, to zły pomysł*, *lepiej coś praktycznego* (something practical would be better). *Nie znam się na tym* is I know nothing about it."
      }
    }
  ],
